{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-4-2","kind":"proposition","title":"在圆内作与给定三角形相似的三角形","englishTitle":"In a given circle to inscribe a triangle equiangular with a given triangle.","book":4,"number":2,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.2","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.2/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":2,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-4-2@raw-b18cd192a69e9590","contentId":"euclid-4-2","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b18cd192a69e959074771cae1ebc90f8b14e5a10857cfe29d4ec45ae014fa96f","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-4-2.statement","euclid-4-2.construction.1","euclid-4-2.construction.2","euclid-4-2.proof.1","euclid-4-2.proof.2","euclid-4-2.proof.3","euclid-4-2.conclusion","euclid-4-2.historical.1","euclid-4-2.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-4-2.statement","contentId":"euclid-4-2","revisionId":"euclid-4-2@raw-b18cd192a69e9590","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d4e068b944dba043faedad2491cfaa5b78d6e78c6f43f337535b211693164c24","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In a given circle to inscribe a triangle equiangular with a given triangle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在给定的圆中,将三角形的角与给定的三角形相连接。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有圜求作圜内三角切形与所设三角形等角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有一个圆，找出圆内三角形的切线以及等于三角形设定角的角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-2.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-4-2","revisionId":"euclid-4-2@raw-b18cd192a69e9590","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ed955b8ddf2b6b2414daf0342c57a1a08c6f7e31208daba737124139673ad09","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be the given circle, and DEF the given triangle; thus it is required to inscribe in the circle ABC a triangle equiangular with the triangle DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC是给定的圆,让DEF是给定的三角;因此,必须在圆圈中加入一个三角形ABC与三角形DEF的对等角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-2.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-4-2","revisionId":"euclid-4-2@raw-b18cd192a69e9590","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c2110735c72a9e7e0c9c4a465c3c9115870d3c4f356d81add047ff875b50c7b7","citations":["euclid-3-16","euclid-1-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let GH be drawn touching the circle ABC at A [[III. 16, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-16)]; on the straight line AH, and at the point A on it, let the angle HAC be constructed equal to the angle DEF, and on the straight line AG, and at the point A on it, let the angle GAB be constructed equal to the angle DFE; [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)] let BC be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘制GH幅,触摸ABC幅,A幅;在AH线上,在A线上,将HAC角与DEF角相仿,在AG线上,将GAB角与DFE角相仿;将BC角相连接。 [[III. 16, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-16)] [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-2.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-4-2","revisionId":"euclid-4-2@raw-b18cd192a69e9590","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"431a9d5614f63ff49481e77a8149df22ed11739ddb8858e101c9221179bbb434","citations":["euclid-3-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since a straight line AH touches the circle ABC, and from the point of contact at A the straight line AC is drawn across in the circle, therefore the angle HAC is equal to the angle ABC in the alternate segment of the circle. [[III. 32](/principles/euclid-3-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后,由于一条直线AH触摸了ABC圆,从A接触点,直线AC划过圆形,因此,角HAC等于圆形另一段的角ABC。 [[III. 32](/principles/euclid-3-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-2.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-4-2","revisionId":"euclid-4-2@raw-b18cd192a69e9590","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8044e0bd8b99031e6bcec3154a7cc1276e7ee4edb27eec4b7736566c87c047b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle HAC is equal to the angle DEF; therefore the angle ABC is also equal to the angle DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但HAC角等于DEF角,因此ABC角也等于DEF角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-2.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-4-2","revisionId":"euclid-4-2@raw-b18cd192a69e9590","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"785feabec00ae1af40d28f7360156ea00395369cc6b37d1630c813c4b59e6efd","citations":["euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the angle ACB is also equal to the angle DFE; therefore the remaining angle BAC is also equal to the remaining angle EDF. [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,ACB角也等于DFE角;因此,其余BAC角也等于其余的EDF角。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-2.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-4-2","revisionId":"euclid-4-2@raw-b18cd192a69e9590","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"11878ab5e65b4aeb0cc492ed59de2e9d47f554266622e6023ea46624f2b0bba1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in the given circle there has been inscribed a triangle equiangular with the given triangle. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在给定的圆上,刻有三角形的等角,与给定的三角形Q. E.F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-2.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-4-2","revisionId":"euclid-4-2@raw-b18cd192a69e9590","order":7,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4ed837d0f69490c52f3d564d3a71b2937d5f8a8441e9f02f444f236bf3ad2907","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有圜求作圜内三角切形与所设三角形等角法曰甲乙丙圜求作圜内三角切形其三角与所设丁戊己形之三角各等先作庚辛线切圜于甲〈三卷十七〉次作庚甲乙角与设形之己角等次作辛甲丙角与设形之戊角等末作乙丙线即圜内三角切形与所设丁戊己形等角论曰甲丙乙与庚甲乙两角等甲乙丙与辛甲丙两角亦等〈三卷卅二〉而庚甲乙辛甲丙两角既与所设己戊两角各等即甲丙乙甲乙丙亦与己戊各等而乙甲丙必与丁等〈一卷卅二〉则三角俱等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"给定一个圆和一个三角形，在这个圆内作一个与给定三角形对应角相等的内接三角形。设圆为甲乙丙，给定三角形为丁戊己。先作直线庚辛，使它在甲处与圆相切〈三卷十七〉；再作角庚甲乙等于角己、角辛甲丙等于角戊，最后连接乙丙。由切线与弦所成的角等于相应圆周角，可知角甲丙乙等于角庚甲乙，角甲乙丙等于角辛甲丙〈三卷卅二〉，所以这两个角分别等于给定的角己、角戊。再根据三角形内角和，剩下的角乙甲丙等于角丁〈一卷卅二〉。因此，内接三角形甲乙丙与给定三角形丁戊己三组对应角都相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-2.source","contentId":"euclid-4-2","revisionId":"euclid-4-2@raw-b18cd192a69e9590","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a30a54066ffb0300f5f22b1f83a4c036602a2e9baaf981b998f751f2d06a3024","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.2/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.2\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-4-2:euclid-3-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-2.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"III. 16, Por."}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-2:euclid-1-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-2.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-23","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"I. 23"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-2:euclid-3-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-2.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"III. 32"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-2:euclid-1-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-2.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"I. 32"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-4-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-11.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-4-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"IV. 2"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-13:euclid-4-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-13.construction.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-4-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.13","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.13/","sourceLabel":"IV. 2"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-2:euclid-3-16:explicit","id":"euclid-3-16","book":3,"number":16,"kind":"proposition","title":"圆的切线垂直于切点处的半径","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-2:euclid-1-23:explicit","id":"euclid-1-23","book":1,"number":23,"kind":"proposition","title":"在给定点复制一个角","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-2:euclid-3-32:explicit","id":"euclid-3-32","book":3,"number":32,"kind":"proposition","title":"弦切角定理","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-2:euclid-1-32:explicit","id":"euclid-1-32","book":1,"number":32,"kind":"proposition","title":"三角形内角和与外角定理","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-4-2:explicit","id":"euclid-4-11","book":4,"number":11,"kind":"proposition","title":"圆内接正五边形的尺规作图","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-1